edia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Eucalyptus_foliage_isobilateral_dorsiventral_IMG_0588e.JPG/1280px-Eucalyptus_foliage_isobilateral_dorsiventral_IMG_0588e.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Eucalyptus_foliage_isobilateral_dorsiventral_IMG_0588e.JPG/500px-Eucalyptus_foliage_isobilateral_dorsiventral_IMG_0588e.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Near the ground these Eucalyptus saplings have juvenile dorsiventral foliage from the previous year, but this season their newly sprouting foliage is isobilateral, like the mature foliage on the adult trees above.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEucalyptus_foliage_isobilateral_dorsiventral_IMG_0588e.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Rosa_canina_blatt_2005.05.26_11.50.13.jpg/500px-Rosa_canina_blatt_2005.05.26_11.50.13.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Rosa_canina_blatt_2005.05.26_11.50.13.jpg/500px-Rosa_canina_blatt_2005.05.26_11.50.13.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Rosa canina: Petiole, two stipules, rachis, five leaflets","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARosa_canina_blatt_2005.05.26_11.50.13.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Citrus_leaf%28crop%29.jpg/500px-Citrus_leaf%28crop%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Citrus_leaf%28crop%29.jpg/500px-Citrus_leaf%28crop%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Citrus leaves with translucent glands[16]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACitrus_leaf(crop).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3